---
layout: layouts/index.njk
eyebrow: Exams
title: The exam index
lede: Vendor certifications for AI-infrastructure roles, each with a verdict — core, optional, later or skip. Filter below; every row is in the page source even with JavaScript off.
---
<div class="filters" data-verdict-table="exams" role="group" aria-label="Filter exams by verdict">
  <button type="button" data-verdict="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
  <button type="button" data-verdict="core" aria-pressed="false">Core</button>
  <button type="button" data-verdict="opt" aria-pressed="false">Optional</button>
  <button type="button" data-verdict="later" aria-pressed="false">Later</button>
  <button type="button" data-verdict="skip" aria-pressed="false">Skip</button>
</div>

<div class="idx-wrap">
<table class="idx" data-verdict-table="exams">
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">Exam</th><th scope="col">Vendor</th><th scope="col">Price</th><th scope="col">Format</th><th scope="col">Verdict</th><th scope="col">Path</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for row in site.exams %}
    <tr data-verdict="{{ row.verdict }}">
      <td><a href="/exams/{{ row.id }}/">{{ row.name }}</a></td>
      <td>{{ row.vendor }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.price }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.format }}</td>
      <td>{% set verdict = row.verdict %}{% include "partials/verdict-chip.njk" %}</td>
      <td>{% for p in site.paths %}{% if p.id == row.path %}<a href="/paths/{{ p.id }}/">{{ p.name.split(':')[0] }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<script src="/assets/js/verdict.js" defer></script>
